    {"name": "Master Theorem", "equation": "T(n) = aT(n/b) + f(n) \\implies T(n) = \\Theta(n^{\\log_b a}) \\text{ if } f(n)=O(n^{\\log_b a-\\varepsilon})", "context": "Algorithm analysis"},
